{"number":573,"title":"AutoLoCo: Communication Efficient Distributed LLM Training via Adaptive Synchronization","labels":["Distributed Training","LLM","マルチDC"],"state":"open","created_at":"2026-09-30T18:19:22Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T15:38:20Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Hiroki11x/Papers/issues/573","body":"## Links\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2609.36662\n\n<img width=\"859\" height=\"529\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89c69ebe-d7da-4220-aa79-2f883f6fa588\" />\n\n\n<img width=\"905\" height=\"369\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97463964-18e6-4a3d-8344-e4d00b3281d3\" />\n\n\n## TLDR\n\nDiLoCo に関して、H を動的に変える\nstepsじゃなく、処理したデータを元に動的に変える\n\nただこのままじゃうまくいかない\n\n外部 optimizer の補正をする　（momentum とか LR とか）\n\nInt 8を使ってる\n\nMuon は使ってない\n\n<img width=\"605\" height=\"314\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ebcb1a3-54c4-4c43-bfe0-5f463e8a8b44\" />\n\n<img width=\"566\" height=\"315\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee6c7973-3f57-41ef-90c7-b8dd9b1813a1\" />\n\n<img width=\"585\" height=\"656\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a727e1b2-fa98-4711-8d92-71fffd00e1f1\" />"}
